    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Mind sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may target an individual creature with a lesser charm an additional amount of times per day equal to your casting ability modifier (minimum 1). Additionally, if a creature would successfully save against your lesser charms, it does not count towards the maximum amount of times you may target an individual creature in a day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mind#toc89\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
